title: 'statement gossip: score a resent banned statement against the sender'

doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    On nodes running the v2 DHT statement path, a peer that resends a statement the store has
    removed and banned, such as a forwarded transient statement, now loses a small amount of its
    per-peer score. Nodes without the v2 DHT path enabled are unaffected.

crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: patch
